---
title: Planning System Execution Workflow
description: Feature planning from request to autonomous execution
category: Workflow
priority: CRITICAL
version: 4.0.0
---

%%{
  init: {
    'theme': 'base',
    'themeVariables': {
      'actorTextColor': '#fff',
      'actorBkg': '#7B68EE',
      'actorBorder': '#5A4FCF'
    }
  }
}%%

sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Plan as 🎭 Planning Orchestrator
    participant Complexity as 📊 Complexity Analyzer
    participant Validator as ✅ Plan Validator
    participant Executor as ⚙️ Phase Executor
    participant TDD as 🧪 TDD Orchestrator
    participant Progress as 📈 Progress Tracker
    
    %% Initialization
    User->>Plan: plan [feature description]
    activate Plan
    Plan->>Plan: Parse user request
    Plan->>Plan: 🎭 Orchestrator engaged: PlanningOrchestrator
    
    %% Phase 1: Analyze Complexity
    rect rgb(74, 144, 226)
        Note over Plan,Complexity: PHASE 1: ANALYZE COMPLEXITY
        Plan->>Complexity: Analyze feature complexity
        activate Complexity
        
        Complexity->>Complexity: Scan for triggers:<br/>• security, auth, authentication<br/>• migration, database<br/>• API, integration<br/>• payment, billing
        
        Complexity->>Complexity: Calculate metrics:<br/>• Estimated LOC<br/>• Component count<br/>• Integration points<br/>• Risk factors
        
        alt HIGH Complexity Detected
            Complexity-->>Plan: 🔥 HIGH complexity<br/>Route: INCREMENTAL
            Note over Plan: Triggers:<br/>• Security/Auth<br/>• Migrations<br/>• APIs<br/>• Payments
        else MEDIUM Complexity
            Complexity-->>Plan: ⚠️ MEDIUM complexity<br/>Route: CONDITIONAL
        else LOW Complexity
            Complexity-->>Plan: ✅ LOW complexity<br/>Route: SKELETON
        end
        deactivate Complexity
    end
    
    %% Phase 2: Generate Plan
    rect rgb(80, 200, 120)
        Note over Plan,Validator: PHASE 2: GENERATE PLAN
        Plan->>Plan: Select plan template<br/>(incremental/conditional/skeleton)
        
        Plan->>Plan: Break feature into phases:<br/>• Phase 1: Setup & Foundation<br/>• Phase 2: Core Implementation<br/>• Phase 3: Integration<br/>• Phase 4: Testing & Validation<br/>• Phase 5: Documentation
        
        Plan->>Plan: Add TDD requirements:<br/>• RED phase per feature<br/>• GREEN implementation<br/>• REFACTOR cycle
        
        Plan->>Validator: Validate plan compliance
        activate Validator
        
        Validator->>Validator: Check Definition of Ready (DoR):<br/>• Clear acceptance criteria ✓<br/>• Dependencies identified ✓<br/>• Testability defined ✓<br/>• Security requirements ✓
        
        Validator->>Validator: Check Definition of Done (DoD):<br/>• Tests passing ✓<br/>• Code reviewed ✓<br/>• Documentation updated ✓<br/>• Integration validated ✓
        
        Validator-->>Plan: ✅ Plan compliant
        deactivate Validator
        
        Plan->>User: 📋 Plan generated:<br/>{N} phases, {M} tasks<br/>Estimated: {X} hours
        Plan->>User: Execute autonomously?
    end
    
    %% Phase 3: Execute Plan
    rect rgb(243, 156, 18)
        Note over Plan,Progress: PHASE 3: EXECUTE PLAN (AUTONOMOUS)
        User->>Plan: execute all phases autonomously
        Plan->>Plan: 🎭 Phase transition: PLANNING → EXECUTION
        
        loop For Each Phase
            Plan->>Executor: Execute phase {N}
            activate Executor
            
            Executor->>Executor: Load phase definition
            Executor->>Executor: Check prerequisites
            
            alt Prerequisites Not Met
                Executor-->>Plan: ⚠️ Prerequisites missing
                Plan->>Plan: Handle dependency:<br/>Execute prerequisite phase first
            else Prerequisites Met
                Executor->>Executor: Execute phase tasks
                
                alt Phase Has TDD Requirement
                    Executor->>TDD: Invoke TDD workflow
                    activate TDD
                    TDD->>TDD: RED → GREEN → REFACTOR
                    TDD-->>Executor: ✅ TDD cycle complete
                    deactivate TDD
                end
                
                Executor->>Executor: Validate phase outputs
                Executor-->>Plan: ✅ Phase {N} complete
            end
            deactivate Executor
            
            Plan->>Progress: Update progress
            activate Progress
            Progress->>Progress: Calculate completion %
            Progress->>Progress: Update milestone checkboxes
            Progress->>Progress: Log phase completion
            Progress-->>Plan: Progress updated: {P}%
            deactivate Progress
            
            Plan->>User: ✅ Phase {N} complete ({P}% done)
        end
    end
    
    %% Phase 4: Validate & Report
    rect rgb(231, 76, 60)
        Note over Plan,Validator: PHASE 4: VALIDATE & REPORT
        Plan->>Validator: Validate all acceptance criteria
        activate Validator
        
        loop For Each Acceptance Criterion
            Validator->>Validator: Test criterion: {criterion}
            
            alt Criterion Failed
                Validator-->>Plan: ❌ {criterion} failed
                Plan->>Plan: Log failure
                Plan->>Executor: Re-execute failed phase
            else Criterion Passed
                Validator-->>Plan: ✅ {criterion} passed
            end
        end
        
        Validator-->>Plan: Final validation complete
        deactivate Validator
        
        Plan->>Plan: Generate completion report:<br/>• Phases completed: {N}/{N}<br/>• Tests passing: {M}/{M}<br/>• DoD met: YES<br/>• Total time: {X} hours<br/>• Efficiency: {Y}%
        
        Plan->>Plan: Update documentation:<br/>• Implementation guide<br/>• Architecture diagrams<br/>• API documentation<br/>• User guide
        
        Plan->>Plan: 🎭 Orchestrator completing:<br/>✅ ALL WORK COMPLETE
        
        Plan->>User: 🎉 Feature Complete!<br/>✅ All {N} phases executed<br/>✅ All {M} tests passing<br/>✅ DoD criteria met<br/>📊 Efficiency: {Y}%<br/>📝 Documentation updated
    end
    
    deactivate Plan
    
    %% Alternative: Manual Execution
    Note over User,Plan: Alternative: Manual Phase Execution<br/>execute phase [N]<br/>Allows step-by-step validation
